          "source_text": "选自行车",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "就不买24寸自行车了，买26寸的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这是买给你最后一辆车了。如果后面还买只能你自己挣钱买了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "迪卡侬26寸自行车，红色/蓝色，1米4就能骑。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "另外是捷安特这款，1米45就能骑。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "如果你再等两年，这辆车到1米52才能骑，也是捷安特的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "就买26寸的",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你等得越久，就可以买更好的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
