            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "C'est le dernier vélo qu'on t'achète. Si tu en veux encore un plus tard, tu devras gagner de l'argent et te l'acheter toi-même.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:30:08+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Decathlon a un vélo de 26 pouces, rouge ou bleu. On peut rouler avec dès qu'on mesure 1,40 mètre.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:30:12+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Cet autre modèle est de Giant. On peut rouler avec dès qu'on mesure 1,45 mètre.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:30:14+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Si tu attends encore deux ans, tu pourras prendre celui-ci. Il faut mesurer au moins 1,52 mètre pour rouler avec. C'est aussi un Giant.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-07-11-choosing-a-bike_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
